Subject: [PATCH] Native owned static reservations and MEM2 physical backing
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Reserve real SDK physical backing before game arena capture, retain original
module byte storage with exact inverse lookup, and pin static owners while DMA
accesses are live. Keep MEM2 physical base 0x10000000 and actual DMA alignment.
This is hardware transport; no firmware execution or game readiness.

